01:31:04.937 --> 01:31:08.646
That guy was down over 15 seconds.


01:31:09.017 --> 01:31:11.212
[MAN SPEAKS IN JAPANESE]
[BELL DINGS]


01:31:14.737 --> 01:31:18.286
Where the hell did you get this ref?
The man's gonna get my man beat.


01:31:18.457 --> 01:31:20.254
BRIGHT:
He was down way more than 10.


01:31:20.417 --> 01:31:22.009
Ten? Shit, it was more like 20.


01:31:22.177 --> 01:31:23.326
Get me the enswell.


01:31:23.497 --> 01:31:26.887
- Yo, you got any other stuff in there?
- I don't know.


01:31:29.057 --> 01:31:31.776
RORY: Where the fuck's the enswell?
BRIGHT: We don't have an enswell.


01:31:31.937 --> 01:31:34.735
- Give me an ice pack.
RORY: Give him an ice pack, Jay.


01:31:34.897 --> 01:31:36.569
BRIGHT:
Just a second.


01:31:37.017 --> 01:31:38.450
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:31:42.897 --> 01:31:44.125
REFEREE:
Fight!


01:31:44.857 --> 01:31:46.734
[BOTH GRUNTING]


01:31:48.737 --> 01:31:50.056
MAN:
That's it!


01:31:54.137 --> 01:31:55.411
That's it!


01:32:00.777 --> 01:32:03.530
RORY: There you go. Body shots.
Hit him, man.


01:32:08.377 --> 01:32:10.766
[BOTH PANTING]


01:32:11.617 --> 01:32:13.130
REFEREE:
Punch your way out.


01:32:13.297 --> 01:32:14.889
RORY:
Keep working, now.


01:32:24.017 --> 01:32:25.814
Come on, get out of there, Mike!


01:32:31.377 --> 01:32:33.368
RORY:
Keep your eyes open!


01:32:37.097 --> 01:32:39.850
<i>REPORTER 1: After the knockdown,
Tyson unable to capture...</i>


01:32:44.657 --> 01:32:46.966
RORY: Stick and move, Mike!
Stick and move!


01:32:47.137 --> 01:32:49.697
Keep moving, Mikey!
Keep moving! Shit!


01:32:55.617 --> 01:32:56.606
[DINGS]


01:32:57.777 --> 01:32:59.529
REFEREE:
Go to your corners.


01:32:59.857 --> 01:33:01.290
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:33:02.817 --> 01:33:04.773
RORY:
Get in the chair, Mike.


01:33:07.417 --> 01:33:11.092
TYSON: Where's the fucking chair?
RORY: Damn it, Jay, get the stool!


01:33:12.097 --> 01:33:14.247
Give me the damn stool!


01:33:17.657 --> 01:33:19.329
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:33:22.137 --> 01:33:23.650
- Ice.
- Get some fucking ice.


01:33:23.817 --> 01:33:25.535
- We don't have none.
- Well, find some.


01:33:25.697 --> 01:33:27.050
His fucking eye's closing up.


01:33:27.217 --> 01:33:29.572
Rory, put some Vaseline
right on this eye.


01:33:29.737 --> 01:33:31.648
- Aboline.
- Aboline? What's that?


01:33:31.817 --> 01:33:33.694
- I'm allergic to Vaseline.
- Oh, shit.


01:33:33.857 --> 01:33:35.370
We got any of that in there?


01:33:35.537 --> 01:33:39.416
Shit. Aw, shit.


01:33:41.537 --> 01:33:42.856
Fuck.


01:33:50.937 --> 01:33:52.495
CORNER MAN:
Listen to me, James. Listen!


01:33:56.177 --> 01:33:58.486
He ain't got nothing left.


01:33:58.657 --> 01:34:01.967
Keep working harder, all right?
Let's go to work. Come on!


01:34:02.137 --> 01:34:04.287
REFEREE:
Ready?


01:34:08.897 --> 01:34:11.331
RORY:
Let's go. Come on!


01:34:11.497 --> 01:34:12.486
[BELL DINGS]


01:34:12.657 --> 01:34:13.646
REFEREE:
Fight!


01:34:17.017 --> 01:34:18.416
SNOWELL:
Keep working!


01:34:18.577 --> 01:34:21.535
- Keep working, Mike!
- Stick and move, baby! Yes! Yes!


01:34:29.497 --> 01:34:31.567
<i>REPORTER 1:
Tyson 's eye now completely shut.</i>


01:34:31.737 --> 01:34:34.205
<i>He can 't see
Douglas 's punches coming...</i>


01:34:34.377 --> 01:34:36.937
<i>... and Buster is landing a lot of them
in succession.</i>


01:34:37.097 --> 01:34:39.975
<i>REPORTER 2: It's been said that the
only man who could beat Mike Tyson...</i>


01:34:40.137 --> 01:34:41.855
<i>... was Mike Tyson himself...</i>


01:34:42.377 --> 01:34:45.050
<i>... but he's getting a lot of help
from a challenger...</i>


01:34:48.137 --> 01:34:50.697
- Keep moving, baby!
- Mike, you gotta keep moving.


01:34:51.697 --> 01:34:53.016
[TYSON GRUNTS]


01:35:17.457 --> 01:35:20.096
- Come on, Mike!
- Come on, champ!


01:35:22.777 --> 01:35:23.892
Three!


01:35:24.057 --> 01:35:27.891
<i>REPORTER 1: If Mike Tyson doesn 't
get up, this will be the biggest upset...</i>


01:35:28.057 --> 01:35:31.254
<i>... in the history of
heavyweight championship...</i>


01:35:31.417 --> 01:35:34.250
RORY:
Mike, you gotta get up!


01:35:40.937 --> 01:35:42.848
REFEREE:
Five!


01:35:50.017 --> 01:35:51.166
Six!


01:35:51.337 --> 01:35:54.170
RORY: Come on, Mike!
SNOWELL: Come on! Don't give up!


01:35:59.737 --> 01:36:01.932
Seven!


01:36:12.497 --> 01:36:13.725
Eight!


01:36:16.937 --> 01:36:18.609
<i>Nine!</i>


01:36:22.417 --> 01:36:24.931
It's over! You're out!


01:36:25.337 --> 01:36:27.214
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:36:41.537 --> 01:36:44.256
<i>REPORTER 2:
Live fast, die young.</i>


01:36:44.417 --> 01:36:49.013
<i>Will Mike Tyson ever get up
from this knockout?</i>


01:36:50.377 --> 01:36:52.254
[INAUDIBLE DIALOGUE]


01:37:01.497 --> 01:37:03.453
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:37:05.977 --> 01:37:11.176
<i>KING: Buster Douglas was on the canvas
for 16 seconds. He was out!</i>


01:37:11.337 --> 01:37:14.249
No, you listen to me. I got the tape...


01:37:14.417 --> 01:37:18.092
...and I'm taking it to the WBA,
the WBC and the IBF.


01:37:18.257 --> 01:37:19.246
All of them!


01:37:19.417 --> 01:37:23.376
And they're gonna see that there was
a knockout in the eighth round.


01:37:23.537 --> 01:37:26.449
No, no. Mike Tyson's
not losing his belt...


01:37:26.617 --> 01:37:29.256
...because some referee
forgot how to count.


01:37:29.417 --> 01:37:31.612
That's not right.
You know it's not right.


01:37:31.777 --> 01:37:35.736
Don't you even know how to cut tape?
Get that shit off of him.


01:37:39.377 --> 01:37:41.288
I'm gonna take care of this
for you, Mike.


01:37:41.457 --> 01:37:43.732
And you know I always do what I say.


01:37:45.697 --> 01:37:47.210
I know you do, man.


01:37:47.377 --> 01:37:49.937
You're gonna get it all back.


01:37:50.097 --> 01:37:52.611
Either they reverse their decision, or...


01:37:52.777 --> 01:37:58.056
- I didn't have it out there tonight.
- Fuck that! You won the fight, Mike.


01:37:59.977 --> 01:38:02.571
- On my back?
- The fight was over!


01:38:05.417 --> 01:38:06.896
I lost.


01:38:07.057 --> 01:38:10.049
Goddamn you, Mike.


01:38:10.217 --> 01:38:13.926
I don't wanna hear that kind of talk,
that goddamned defeatist attitude.


01:38:14.097 --> 01:38:16.565
You did not lose.


01:38:18.617 --> 01:38:20.016
I'm gonna prove it...


01:38:20.177 --> 01:38:24.534
...and you are not gonna fuck me up.


01:38:25.737 --> 01:38:27.170
You understand me?


01:38:29.817 --> 01:38:33.651
Okay, Don. I see your point.


01:38:34.337 --> 01:38:36.407
I did not lose.


01:38:38.177 --> 01:38:39.576
[REPORTERS CLAMOURING]


01:38:39.737 --> 01:38:41.648
REPORTER 1:
Hey, Don. What have you got to say?


01:38:41.817 --> 01:38:43.011
I gotta go feed the seals.


01:38:43.177 --> 01:38:44.815
REPORTER 2:
That kid took a beating there.


01:38:44.977 --> 01:38:46.126
KING:
Hey, fellas.


01:38:46.937 --> 01:38:51.374
All you're getting tonight is the truth.
He was down in the eighth round.


01:38:54.817 --> 01:38:56.614
RORY:
You want anything else?


01:38:58.977 --> 01:39:01.013
I wanna go home.


01:39:56.097 --> 01:39:57.610
[TYSON CHUCKLES]


01:39:58.617 --> 01:40:00.175
CAMILLE:
What is so funny?


01:40:02.137 --> 01:40:06.369
"Who ate my ice cream?
Don't you never eat my ice cream."


01:40:06.817 --> 01:40:08.375
[BOTH LAUGHING]


01:40:33.177 --> 01:40:34.849
REPORTER 1:
Hey, Mike, how about a rematch?


01:40:35.017 --> 01:40:39.454
<i>MAN: I would like to focus on the
37 hours you were here in Indianapolis...</i>


01:40:39.617 --> 01:40:43.451
<i>... beginning with your arrival
on July 17th, 1991...</i>


01:40:43.617 --> 01:40:47.405
<i>... in order to participate
in the Miss Black America pageant.</i>


01:40:47.577 --> 01:40:49.568
REPORTER 2:
How does it feel not to be champ?


01:40:49.737 --> 01:40:50.886
You tell me, we both know.


01:40:51.057 --> 01:40:54.049
REPORTER 2: What about the rumours
that you and Robin are seeing each other?


01:40:54.217 --> 01:40:55.206
Kiss my what?


01:40:55.377 --> 01:40:56.890
REPORTER 2:
No, the rumours that you and...


01:40:57.057 --> 01:41:01.050
<i>MAN: Mr. Tyson, once you arrived
at the Omni Hotel, what did you do?</i>


01:41:01.217 --> 01:41:03.890
- Hey, man. Good to see you.
- Charlie Neal.


01:41:04.057 --> 01:41:06.969
Hey, Mike,
Charlie Neal and Johnny Gill.


01:41:07.137 --> 01:41:09.731
- Hey, man, I like your music, man.
- Good to meet you.


01:41:09.897 --> 01:41:12.650
Yo, man. So when are we
gonna see these, uh, beauties?


01:41:12.817 --> 01:41:15.047
Well, right after you do
that promo for me, Mike.


01:41:15.217 --> 01:41:18.129
I don't know, man.
I think it's gonna be the other way.


01:41:24.217 --> 01:41:26.208
[DANCE MUSIC PLAYING
OVER SPEAKERS]


01:41:28.377 --> 01:41:32.893
COORDINATOR: Two, three, four,
five, six, seven and be there. Got it?


01:41:35.337 --> 01:41:37.771
Let's go, girls.
We don't have much time.


01:41:39.017 --> 01:41:41.895
- Darnelle, remember your place.
- I'm in trouble now, man.


01:41:43.697 --> 01:41:46.973
<i>MAN: Miss Washington,
describe the contestants ' reaction...</i>


01:41:47.137 --> 01:41:48.934
<i>... when Mike came into the room.</i>


01:41:49.097 --> 01:41:51.406
<i>DESIREE:
We were all very excited.</i>


01:41:51.577 --> 01:41:53.568
<i>MAN:
Am I to understand that at some point...</i>


01:41:53.737 --> 01:41:57.047
<i>... Mr. Tyson was asked to participate
in the rehearsal?</i>


01:41:58.137 --> 01:41:59.206
<i>DESIREE:
Yes.</i>


01:41:59.377 --> 01:42:02.687
<i>MAN: Am I to understand that
at some point during the rehearsal...</i>


01:42:02.857 --> 01:42:06.736
<i>... he hugged you and asked you if
you would like to go out that evening?</i>


01:42:06.897 --> 01:42:08.012
<i>DESIREE:
Yes.</i>


01:42:08.177 --> 01:42:10.372
<i>MAN:
And you had never met him before.</i>


01:42:10.537 --> 01:42:11.811
<i>DESIREE:
No.</i>


01:42:23.817 --> 01:42:25.091
[RINGING]


01:42:25.257 --> 01:42:29.296
<i>DESIREE: We were getting ready
to go to sleep when the phone rang.</i>


01:42:30.137 --> 01:42:31.889
<i>- Hello?
TYSON: Hey, Desiree there?</i>


01:42:32.057 --> 01:42:35.333
<i>- Yes, she is. May I ask who's calling?
- Tell her it's Mike.</i>


01:42:35.497 --> 01:42:39.536
Hold on. Some guy named Mike.


01:42:40.857 --> 01:42:43.246
<i>- Hello?
- Hey. It's me, Mike.</i>


01:42:43.417 --> 01:42:44.691
Mike Tyson?


01:42:44.857 --> 01:42:47.325
<i>- Yeah. We met at the rehearsal.
- Mike Tyson? He's on the phone.</i>


01:42:47.497 --> 01:42:48.691
[GIRLS SHOUTING]


01:42:48.857 --> 01:42:50.210
<i>- Hi.
TYSON: How you doing?</i>


01:42:50.377 --> 01:42:51.446
Okay.


01:42:51.617 --> 01:42:53.448
<i>Listen, why don 't you come down?</i>


01:42:53.617 --> 01:42:55.608
Wait, hold on. Shh!


01:42:56.097 --> 01:43:00.170
<i>- Anything wrong up there?
- No, I'm fine. What's up?</i>


01:43:00.337 --> 01:43:03.807
<i>TYSON: I was wondering if you wanna
come down and go with me to a party.</i>


01:43:03.977 --> 01:43:07.333
<i>DESIREE: Tonight?
Isn 't it kind of late for a party?</i>


01:43:07.977 --> 01:43:10.445
<i>TYSON: Well, there's still
a lot of celebrities there.</i>


01:43:10.617 --> 01:43:11.936
<i>DESIREE:
I don 't know.</i>


01:43:12.097 --> 01:43:14.691
<i>What about tomorrow?
Can we go out then?</i>


01:43:14.857 --> 01:43:17.655
<i>TYSON: No, I wish I could,
but I gotta leave tomorrow.</i>


01:43:17.817 --> 01:43:20.650
<i>Why don 't you come on down?
It'll be fun.</i>


01:43:25.377 --> 01:43:27.095
DRIVER:
Good evening.


01:43:28.657 --> 01:43:31.171
TYSON: Nice dress.
DESIREE: Thanks.


01:43:31.337 --> 01:43:35.410
<i>MAN: Mr. Tyson, after Miss Washington
got in the car, what did you do?</i>


01:43:35.577 --> 01:43:36.930
<i>TYSON:
I kissed her.</i>


01:43:37.097 --> 01:43:39.486
<i>MAN: And how did she react?
TYSON: She kissed me.</i>


01:43:39.657 --> 01:43:43.570
TYSON: To the hotel.
DESIREE: Is the party there?


01:43:43.737 --> 01:43:47.286
TYSON: No. I just gotta go there
and pick up my bodyguard.


01:43:47.457 --> 01:43:50.449
DESIREE:
Oh. Mike Tyson needs a bodyguard?


01:43:50.617 --> 01:43:52.289
TYSON: Yeah, that's right.
DESIREE: Ha-ha!


01:43:52.457 --> 01:43:54.925
- Where you from again?
- I'm from Rhode Island.


01:43:55.737 --> 01:43:58.410
<i>DESIREE: I thought we were just going
to pick up his bodyguard...</i>


01:43:58.577 --> 01:44:03.093
<i>... before going out on the town to all
these after-parties with other celebrities.</i>


01:44:04.617 --> 01:44:07.734
<i>MAN: When you got out of the elevator,
where did you and Mike go?</i>


01:44:07.897 --> 01:44:10.695
<i>DESIREE:
We walked the hall to his room.</i>


01:44:11.257 --> 01:44:12.485
DESIREE:
Do you have any pets?


01:44:14.097 --> 01:44:16.406
- I got pigeons.
- Yeah?


01:44:16.577 --> 01:44:18.886
How many do you have?


01:44:19.777 --> 01:44:24.168
- I don't know. Something like 200.
- Two hundred? Really?


01:44:24.657 --> 01:44:27.729
That's really neat. I've got a puppy.


01:44:27.897 --> 01:44:29.330
Uh-huh.


01:44:32.017 --> 01:44:35.248
We'll just be here a second.
Come on in.


01:45:02.137 --> 01:45:05.686
<i>CUS: What's the difference
between the hero and the coward?</i>


01:45:06.177 --> 01:45:08.008
<i>There ain 't no difference.</i>


01:45:08.177 --> 01:45:11.169
<i>They both feel exactly the same
on the inside.</i>


01:45:11.337 --> 01:45:15.216
<i>They both fear dying and getting hurt.</i>


01:45:16.057 --> 01:45:19.572
<i>TYSON: It's what the hero does
that makes him a hero...</i>


01:45:19.737 --> 01:45:24.208
<i>... and what the other doesn 't do
that makes him a coward.</i>

